                    </labels>
                <created>Wed, 25 Feb 2015 07:47:50 +0000</created>
                <updated>Wed, 21 Nov 2018 04:16:00 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Thu, 8 Nov 2018 07:47:58 +0000</resolved>
                                    <version>sprint-2</version>
                                    <fixVersion>2.8</fixVersion>
                                    <component>cache</component>
                    <component>wizards</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>1</votes>
                                    <watches>2</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16571473" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 7 Aug 2018 11:23:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added possibility to enable/disable collection of cache statistics.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See help for &lt;b&gt;cache -statistics&lt;/b&gt; command.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16594623" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 28 Aug 2018 06:59:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;My test failed:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start a new cache in runtime&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;toggle statistics ON&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;but actually, there are no statistics are collected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;please investigate.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also please make the only possible options -enable and -disable&lt;br/&gt;
Because of this, I was able to set any string as the second option to OFF statistics&lt;br/&gt;
cache -statistics -qwerty -c=cache1&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16594709" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 28 Aug 2018 08:41:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed task options. Fixed toggle of statistics collection.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16602911" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 4 Sep 2018 11:05:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Works.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16609470" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 10 Sep 2018 16:32:41 +0000"  >&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Lets move&#160;statisticsEnabled from&#160;VisorCacheMetrics to&#160;VisorCache, because&#160;VisorCacheMetrics not always collected (see collectMetrics in VisorCache)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;VisorCachesToggleStatisticsJob has wrong javadocs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;VisorCacheToggleStatisticsTaskArg, lets use boolean (primitive) not Boolean (object).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;I do not like &quot;-statistics -enable&quot; and &quot;-statistics -disable&quot;, how about &quot;-statistics=on&quot; and&#160;&quot;-statistics=off&quot;?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16611601" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 12 Sep 2018 05:08:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;1-4 implemented. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; please test work of statistics flag.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16611709" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 12 Sep 2018 07:44:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;1) Please fix error message (still contains -enable -disable)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
visor&amp;gt; cache -statistics=on2222 -c=cache1
[WARN ] Goal state &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; collection of cache statistics is not specified.
[WARN ] Use -enable or -disable flags to toggle collection of cache statistics.
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2) Print error in case if the value is missed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
visor&amp;gt; cache -statistics -c=cache1
Time of the snapshot: 2018-09-12 14:46:12
+===============================================================================================================================+
|   Name(@)   |    Mode     | Nodes |    Entries (Heap / Off-heap)    |    Hits     |   Misses    |    Reads     |    Writes    |
+===============================================================================================================================+
| cache1(@c0) | PARTITIONED | 2     | min: 10117 (0 / 10117)          | min: 174    | min: 0      | min: 174     | min: 1901    |
|             |             |       | avg: 10167.50 (0.00 / 10167.50) | avg: 351.50 | avg: 727.00 | avg: 1078.50 | avg: 4465.50 |
|             |             |       | max: 10218 (0 / 10218)          | max: 529    | max: 1454   | max: 1983    | max: 7030    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3) check if statistics is disabled then print some warning about this, for example like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
visor&amp;gt; cache -c=cache1
Time of the snapshot: 2018-09-12 14:49:33
WARNING: statistics is disable &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt; cache, you can enable it using &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;cache -c=&amp;lt;cache&amp;gt; -statistics=on&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
+=====================================================================================================================+
|   Name(@)   |    Mode     | Nodes |    Entries (Heap / Off-heap)    |   Hits    |  Misses   |   Reads   |  Writes   |
+=====================================================================================================================+
| cache1(@c0) | PARTITIONED | 2     | min: 13749 (0 / 13749)          | min: 0    | min: 0    | min: 0    | min: 0    |
|             |             |       | avg: 13871.00 (0.00 / 13871.00) | avg: 0.00 | avg: 0.00 | avg: 0.00 | avg: 0.00 |
|             |             |       | max: 13993 (0 / 13993)          | max: 0    | max: 0    | max: 0    | max: 0    |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16623062" author="vsisko" created="Fri, 21 Sep 2018 04:43:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;1, 2 fixed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3 Information about statistics collection on cache does not exists in visor. Possible separate issue should be created.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16629658" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 27 Sep 2018 02:03:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good. Can be merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16629815" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 27 Sep 2018 06:38:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vsisko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vsisko&quot;&gt;vsisko&lt;/a&gt;, I did minor changes during review.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Take a look and check that toggling statistics working&#160;as expected.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16655008" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 18 Oct 2018 10:20:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Checked. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; Please test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16679393" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 8 Nov 2018 07:47:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16687591" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 15 Nov 2018 07:26:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt;, please retest.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16694202" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 21 Nov 2018 04:15:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Re-tested on the master&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
